+</head>
+<body>
+  <main>
+    <header class="hero">
+      <p class="eyebrow">Feline essentials</p>
+      <h1>Cat FAQ</h1>
+      <p class="intro">Quick answers to common questions about cat behavior, care, and comfort.</p>
+    </header>
+
+    <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
+      <h2 id="faq-title" class="visually-hidden">Frequently asked questions about cats</h2>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-1" id="question-1">
+          <span>Why do cats purr?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-1" hidden>
+          <p>Cats often purr when they feel relaxed, but purring can also be a self-soothing behavior when they are stressed, recovering, or asking for attention.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-2" id="question-2">
