+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-2" hidden>
+          <p>Most adult cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day. Kittens and senior cats may sleep even more because growth and aging both require extra rest.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-3" id="question-3">
+          <span>Why does my cat knead blankets or my lap?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-3" hidden>
+          <p>Kneading is a comforting behavior that begins in kittenhood. Adult cats often knead when they feel safe, content, or ready to settle down.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
+          <span>Should cats be kept indoors?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-4" hidden>
+          <p>Indoor cats are generally safer from traffic, predators, disease, and extreme weather. Enrichment such as toys, climbing spaces, and window perches helps keep indoor cats active.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-5" id="question-5">
+          <span>How can I tell if a cat is happy?</span>
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-5" hidden>
+          <p>A happy cat may have relaxed ears, soft eyes, a gently raised tail, regular eating habits, playful moments, and a willingness to rest near trusted people.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </section>
+  </main>
+
+  <script>
+    const questions = document.querySelectorAll(".question");
+
+    questions.forEach((question) => {
+      question.addEventListener("click", () => {
+        const answer = document.getElementById(question.getAttribute("aria-controls"));
+        const isExpanded = question.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true";
+
+        question.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(!isExpanded));
+        answer.hidden = isExpanded;
+      });
+    });
+  </script>
+</body>
+</html>
*** End Patch
